      "entry": "On completed5m bar: z-score of close minus trailing1h VWAP over trailing2h deviations <=-2; current volume >=1.25x prior1h mean; close >=0.99x completed4h EMA-equivalent anchor; expected distance to VWAP >3x all-in round-trip cost. One position only.",
      "sizing": "Risk <=0.25% equity to1.5ATR stop, capped at20quote units and reserve preserved.",
